WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.449 --> 00:00:19.200
"Stop complaining, Roxy," Cozlin said as they took off.

2
00:00:23.463 --> 00:00:28.166
million light-years sounds far, but we have a Delkorian power crystal.

3
00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:31.128
So the trip will actually be pretty quick."

4
00:00:32.596 --> 00:00:36.199
"Okay," Roxy said, yawning.

5
00:00:40.882 --> 00:00:43.203
They took a short nap in the spaceship's sleeping pods.

6
00:00:44.384 --> 00:00:46.886
When they woke up, they were passing by a huge nebula.

7
00:00:50.588 --> 00:00:52.650
An hour later they reached the Varda Region.

8
00:00:53.991 --> 00:00:56.212
Cozlin pressed a button, and a map appeared.

9
00:00:56.232 --> 00:01:02.693
"The spaceship's computer knows the location of every object in the region," Cozlin said.

10
00:01:03.674 --> 00:01:04.594
She leaned closer.

11
00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:09.459
"Hmm. Something is wrong with one of the planets."

12
00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:15.324
Roxy saw that one planet—a bright green one—was blinking on the map.

13
00:01:16.885 --> 00:01:19.207
Cozlin tapped the planet, causing it to expand.

14
00:01:19.227 --> 00:01:22.210
"Planet Groon," a voice said.

15
00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:28.536
"Located in the Varda Region, Groon is a forest planet with a large population.

16
00:01:29.376 --> 00:01:32.018
The entire surface is covered in trees.

17
00:01:33.078 --> 00:01:36.481
Groonians spend much of their time growing fruit trees."

18
00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:40.283
"That sounds like a nice place," Roxy said.

19
00:01:40.303 --> 00:01:42.704
"Yep," Cozlin said.

20
00:01:42.724 --> 00:01:45.946
"But not anymore.

21
00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:49.248
The sensors aren't picking up any signs of life!"

22
00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:54.792
They flew to Groon and didn't see anything green at all.

23
00:01:55.612 --> 00:02:00.434
Instead, metal structures, along with parts from spaceships and other machines, covered the surface.

24
00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:05.857
"It's as if the entire planet has been turned into a big junkyard!"

25
00:02:06.237 --> 00:02:06.837
Roxy said.

26
00:02:06.857 --> 00:02:11.259
"It's been overrun by robots," Cozlin said.

27
00:02:11.279 --> 00:02:14.500
"Maybe the robots on Delkor came from here."

28
00:02:16.321 --> 00:02:19.342
In the distance they saw a small sphere stuck to the planet.

29
00:02:19.362 --> 00:02:22.704
"That looks like a moon," Roxy said.

30
00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.561
They landed near the sphere and stepped outside.

31
00:02:28.901 --> 00:02:30.762
Roxy's feet clinked on the metal surface.

32
00:02:30.782 --> 00:02:35.963
"I can't believe there was once a forest under here."

33
00:02:37.043 --> 00:02:38.884
Cozlin nodded but didn't say anything.

34
00:02:39.884 --> 00:02:40.765
Roxy knew why.

35
00:02:40.785 --> 00:02:45.466
"She's scared this will happen to Delkor," Roxy thought.

36
00:02:45.486 --> 00:02:47.747
"I know I'm far from home.

37
00:02:48.107 --> 00:02:50.227
But this is where I need to be right now.

38
00:02:51.068 --> 00:02:52.168
Cozlin needs me!"

39
00:02:54.264 --> 00:02:56.726
They walked past all sorts of strange objects.

40
00:02:59.128 --> 00:03:00.789
Some looked like rockets or satellites.

41
00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.872
Others appeared to be vehicles or just scraps of metal.

42
00:03:04.892 --> 00:03:08.294
"Where did all of this come from?"

43
00:03:08.715 --> 00:03:09.335
Roxy said.

44
00:03:10.696 --> 00:03:11.557
Cozlin shrugged.

45
00:03:11.577 --> 00:03:13.038
"Other planets?"

46
00:03:18.302 --> 00:03:21.244
They found an entrance with a walkway that went down into the planet.

47
00:03:22.748 --> 00:03:26.050
As Roxy examined the metal surrounding the entrance, she gasped.

48
00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:32.933
"Here's an M, just like on all the robots back on Delkor!"

49
00:03:32.953 --> 00:03:35.994
"Wow," Cozlin said.

50
00:03:36.014 --> 00:03:38.936
"Then we really are in the right place.

51
00:03:39.396 --> 00:03:40.036
Let's go in!"

52
00:03:41.257 --> 00:03:42.197
She took out a device.

53
00:03:42.217 --> 00:03:44.298
"This can detect life.

54
00:03:44.899 --> 00:03:47.220
If anyone is in here, we'll know."

55
00:03:52.856 --> 00:03:53.957
They went down the walkway.

56
00:03:56.579 --> 00:03:59.641
Cozlin's device beeped regularly as it scanned the environment.

57
00:04:00.682 --> 00:04:02.904
Up ahead, Roxy saw something strange.

58
00:04:04.165 --> 00:04:06.547
A shimmering energy shield filled the corridor.

59
00:04:07.327 --> 00:04:10.369
She could see that the corridor continued on the other side of the shield.

60
00:04:12.391 --> 00:04:14.473
Cozlin stuck her hand through the energy shield.

61
00:04:16.414 --> 00:04:16.974
She shrugged.

62
00:04:16.994 --> 00:04:18.676
"I think it's safe."

63
00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.321
They stepped through it and continued to walk.

64
00:04:26.521 --> 00:04:28.282
Cozlin's device wasn't beeping anymore.

65
00:04:29.942 --> 00:04:30.923
Roxy glanced over.

66
00:04:30.943 --> 00:04:34.984
"I think your device stopped—" "Uh-oh!"

67
00:04:35.484 --> 00:04:36.904
Cozlin said, pointing ahead.

68
00:04:37.544 --> 00:04:39.905
Roxy looked and saw three mean-looking robots.

69
00:04:39.925 --> 00:04:42.286
"I'll get them!"

70
00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:45.987
Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams, but nothing happened.

71
00:04:48.147 --> 00:04:49.008
"Oh no!"

72
00:04:49.508 --> 00:04:50.168
Roxy cried.

73
00:04:51.293 --> 00:04:51.998
"I don't have my
